title: Oracle Workflow Flow
---
%%{init: {"fontSize": 18, "theme": "dark", "themeVariables": {"primaryColor": "#1e2030", "primaryTextColor": "#ffffff", "primaryBorderColor": "#5e6ad2", "lineColor": "#a0a8d0", "secondaryColor": "#2a2d3e", "tertiaryColor": "#131421"}, "flowchart": {"diagramPadding": 30, "nodeSpacing": 50, "rankSpacing": 60}}}%%
flowchart TD
    LIST([oracle list dir]) --> FOUND{"Bounty found\nfor this key?"}
    FOUND -->|No| NONE([No bounties to judge])
    FOUND -->|Yes| OSTATUS[oracle status]

    OSTATUS --> ACCEPTED{"Already\naccepted?"}

    ACCEPTED -->|No| REVIEW{"Review GoalSpec\noracle inspect"}
    REVIEW -->|Accept| ACCEPT[oracle accept\nwrite accepted_at to .bounty\npre-commit s_fail\nstore encrypted in .bounty\nPhase 3 TODO]
    REVIEW -->|Reject| REJECT[oracle reject + reason\nPhase 3 TODO]

    ACCEPTED -->|Yes| ATTEST_READY{"Goal\nachieved?"}

    ATTEST_READY -->|met| EVIDENCE["Gather evidence\nPDF, JSON, video\nor HTTP-JSON feed"]
    ATTEST_READY -->|not met| ATTEST_FAIL[oracle attest not_met\nPhase 3 TODO]
    ATTEST_READY -->|unclear| WAIT([Continue monitoring])

    EVIDENCE --> ATTEST_MET[oracle attest met\nattach evidence BLOB\nsign bounty_id result sha256\nPhase 3 TODO]

    ATTEST_MET --> QUORUM{"Quorum\nreached?"}
    QUORUM -->|Yes| REDEEMABLE([Bounty REDEEMABLE\ns_met published])
    QUORUM -->|No| WAIT2([Awaiting more\nattestations])

    ACCEPT --> ATTEST_READY
    REJECT --> DONE([Oracle rejected\nissuer must revise panel])
    ATTEST_FAIL --> EXPIRY([Await expiry\nfor s_fail release])
